{"id":"d2ad697ec40c2a04","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-derivable.md","title":"可推导","display":"df-derivable — 可推导","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-derivable","aliases":["28-df-derivable"],"display":"df-derivable — 可推导","depends_on":["[[28-df-sequent]]","[[28-df-proof-calculus]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-derivable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-derivable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivable — 可推导"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30782c151faede34\" href=\"?note=30782c151faede34\" title=\"28-df-sequent\">28-df-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85a16660eb135490\" href=\"?note=85a16660eb135490\" title=\"28-df-proof-calculus\">28-df-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-derivable-—-可推导-$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$\">df-derivable — 可推导 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\">\\(E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\)</span> 是有限矢列集，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30782c151faede34\" href=\"?note=30782c151faede34\" title=\"28-df-sequent\">28-df-sequent</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 上的给定演算，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85a16660eb135490\" href=\"?note=85a16660eb135490\" title=\"28-df-proof-calculus\">28-df-proof-calculus</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 有限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\in\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\in\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用有限序列演算的可推导性；有限前提树与按依赖拓扑排序的有限序列等价。演算的具体规则是显式参数。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-derivable-—-可推导-$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$","text":"df-derivable — 可推导 $\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"30782c151faede34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"85a16660eb135490","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"30782c151faede34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)$ 是有限矢列集，see [[28-df-sequent]]。$\\mathrm{SC}$ 是 $E$ 上的给定演算，see [[28-df-proof-calculus]]，$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 有限。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"85a16660eb135490","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)$ 是有限矢列集，see [[28-df-sequent]]。$\\mathrm{SC}$ 是 $E$ 上的给定演算，see [[28-df-proof-calculus]]，$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 有限。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SC}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\in\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1043,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"推导与理论：[[28-df-sequent]]、[[28-df-derivable]]、[[28-df-provable]]、[[28-df-theory]]、[[28-df-logical-consequence]]、[[28-df-satisfiable]]。"}],"outgoing":["30782c151faede34","85a16660eb135490"]}